---
description: API calls go actions then TanStack hooks; UI never imports actions
globs: src/actions/**,src/hooks/**,src/services/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Data flow

```
page / organism
  → hook in src/hooks/{module}/
    → action in src/actions/{module}.js
      → customFetch in src/services/fetch.js
```

# Actions

One file per module (`auth.js`, `programs.js`). Mark `"use server"`. Every request uses `customFetch` from `@/services/fetch`. Do not call `fetch` directly.

# Hooks

One folder per module (`src/hooks/auth/`, `src/hooks/programs/`). Wrap actions with `useQuery` / `useMutation`. Pages and components import hooks only.

```js
// BAD — UI or page
import { sendOtp } from "@/actions/auth"

// GOOD
import { useSendOtp } from "@/hooks/auth/useSendOtp"
```

Static catalogues in `src/lib/data` may be imported directly. Auth, progress, apply, refer, and tutor must go through this path.

Auth is dummy (`src/actions/auth.js` → `/api/auth/*`). Keep that contract; do not call a production login API unless asked.
